   "Emergency medical treatment",
   "Helicopter rescue / evacuation",
   "Trekking at the altitudes on your route",
   "Adventure activities you plan (e.g. rafting, paragliding)",
   "Trip cancellation / interruption",
   "Baggage and documents"
  ],
  "checklist_note": "Checklist items derive from NTB's advice (medical treatment, helicopter rescue) plus the activities in your own plan. Nepal Yatra does not sell insurance."
 },
 "safety_advice": {
  "source": "ntb_emergency",
  "items": [
   "Carry certified copies of passport, insurance papers and your other documents and keep the originals in the safe deposit of your hotel.",
   "In case of loss, theft, cheating, robbery, contact the Tourist Police or the nearest Police Station.",
   "Always use Government authorized travel, trekking and rafting agencies and transportation services.",
   "Exchange money at authorized money exchange dealers and retain the slip.",
   "Do not consume alcohol while trekking above 3,000 meters.",
   "Use designated routes and do not deviate from normal trekking routes; trek in groups rather than alone.",
   "For helicopter evacuation while trekking or mountaineering, contact your local agency."
  ]
 },
